
code_review_findings*.md
# A review report dropped at the root is that round's *input* — scratch,
# like the findings files above. Its output is the verdicts file under
# docs/review-archive/<date>/, which is tracked. 0.8.104 committed this
# one by accident and caught it before the push.
/REVIEW.md

# The snapshot's push message, written into the built tree by
# scripts/build-public-tree.py on every build. It travels with the files
# to whichever host does the GitHub push; it is not part of the
# distribution, and this line is published verbatim so a `git add -A` in
# the public clone cannot commit it either.
/github-commit.txt
